# Stock Library

Read `skills/stock-library/SKILL.md` in full before using it.

Quick reference:
- `bash skills/stock-library/scripts/call.sh stock_sources` — active providers + keys.json template; the USER pastes free keys himself (never create accounts or handle key values).
- `stock_search` (English queries: object + action + setting; orientation by platform) → LOOK at the numbered sheet → `stock_download` ids → `stock_credits` at delivery.
- `commercial=true` default; reject red badges, identifiable people for ads, third-party logos, NASA insignia, watermarks.
